    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. For every backpack in the scene, there is a white shirt located to its left. Directly below the shirt is a blue tie, and to the right of the tie is a black sock. A brown wallet is positioned below the sock. To the right of the wallet lies a pair of scissors. Above the scissors is a ruler, and above the ruler is a screwdriver. A pizza is located to the right of the screwdriver and is positioned on the right side of the image. Finally, a sandwich is placed below the pizza.",
